#  debian_control/control -- dpkg-deb control template for TCTools-Build_Web
#  debian_control/control —— TCTools-Build_Web 的 dpkg-deb control 模板
#
#  This is a TEMPLATE. `deploy_linux.sh` rewrites Version, Architecture,
#  Installed-Size and Maintainer at build time, so the values below are only the
#  documented defaults.
#  本文件是**模板**。`deploy_linux.sh` 会在构建时重写 Version、Architecture、
#  Installed-Size 与 Maintainer，因此下面的值仅为文档化的默认值。
#
#  Install with / 安装方式: sudo apt install ./tctools-buildweb_0.1.0-rc1_amd64.deb
# ============================================================================
Package: tctools-buildweb
Version: 0.1.0-rc1
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 0
Maintainer: turtlelnc <turtlelnc@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/turtlelnc/TCTools-Build_Web
Description: Visual web page builder with Scratch-style block programming
 TCTools-Build_Web (TC-BuildWeb) lets users build web pages visually:
 drag-and-drop layout editing plus Scratch-style graphical block programming,
 with .html/.js export and an optional AI assistant.
 .
 通过TCTools-Build_Web，在软件中通过拖动与图形化编程（scratch）等可视化方式，
 让不会编程的新手也能自由构建属于自己的网页。
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/turtlelnc/TCTools-Build_Web.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/turtlelnc/TCTools-Build_Web

# Qt 6 runtime libraries. The exact package names differ between Ubuntu releases
# (Ubuntu 24.04 ships qml6-module-* packages), so alternatives are declared with
# the "|" operator where several are acceptable.
# Qt 6 运行时库。具体包名在不同 Ubuntu 版本间不同（Ubuntu 24.04 提供
# qml6-module-* 包），因此对可接受多选的情况下使用 "|" 声明备选。
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35),
         libstdc++6 (>= 12),
         libgcc-s1 (>= 12),
         libqt6core6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6gui6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6qml6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6quick6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6quickcontrols2-6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6network6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6sql6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6concurrent6 (>= 6.5),
         libqt6svg6 (>= 6.5),
         qml6-module-qtquick | qml-module-qtquick2,
         qml6-module-qtquick-controls | qml-module-qtquick-controls2,
         qml6-module-qtquick-layouts | qml-module-qtquick-layouts,
         libgl1,
         libxkbcommon0,
         libfontconfig1

# Qt WebEngine is optional (the CMake option TCBW_ENABLE_WEBENGINE degrades
# gracefully), so it is only a recommendation, never a requirement.
# Qt WebEngine 是可选的（CMake 选项 TCBW_ENABLE_WEBENGINE 可优雅降级），
# 因此仅作为推荐项，绝不作硬性依赖。
Recommends: libqt6webenginequick6 | libqt6webengine6,
            qt6-translations-l10n,
            xdg-utils

Suggests: chromium | firefox-esr

# The application builds standards-compliant static output; it needs no
# server-side stack at install time.
# 该应用生成符合标准的静态产物；安装时不需要任何服务端组件。
